  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership and promoting economic development with four rural municipalities in the valley of Pachachaca, Apurmac.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centro de Estudios y Desarrollo Social - APURIMAC (CEDES- APURIMAC), $198,212 over two years CEDES-APURIMAC will provide training, technical assistance, credit and marketing services to more than 900 farm families and their municipal governments as they undertake a coordinated program to develop organic agriculture.</narrative>
